		(descr "Skyworks Si3402-B PoE PD controller, QFN-20 5x5mm, 0.80mm pitch, 2.75mm sq exposed pad. Land pattern per Si3402-B datasheet Rev 1.1 Table 10 / Figure 7 p.18: E=0.80, X1=0.30, Y1=0.95, C1=C2=4.70, P1=P2=2.75. NSMD, 60um mask clearance (p.18 note 4). EP must tie to VNEG (pin 9) plus a 2 sq-in heat spreader with min 9 thermal vias (p.16). Stencil 0.125mm, 2x2 array of 1.2mm openings on 1.4mm pitch over the EP (p.18 notes 6-8).")
